{
    "title": "Trivia Night",
    "description": "Trivia the way it should be!\r\n- Hundreds of popular trivia categories, designed for regular people!\r\n- Multiple types of hints, pick how you want help!\r\n- Easy and free to play!\r\n- Unique ways of asking questions, you need to be clever as well as smart!\r\n\r\nHow is Trivia Night different from the rest? Simple! We found MORE FUN ways of asking YOU all new questions. Ranging from traditional text, to emojis and photos, we\u2019ve assembled a curated collection of trivia that sweeps through hundreds of categories, with questions ranging from easy to hard. And because the questions are often in unique formats, that encourages your brain to find creative ways to connect to the answer. Meaning you have to be clever on some of these!\r\n\r\n<u>Take a tour of knowledge with Trivia categories, such as</u>:\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 MUSIC TRIVIA: From Pop to Hip Hop, and Rock n Roll to Jazz, we\u2019re going to test how much of a fan you really are.\r\n\ud83d\udcfa TV SHOW TRIVIA: We cover all your favorite TV shows! Did you used to watch Cheers or Mash? Pretty Little Liars or 90210? Friends or Seinfeld?! Breaking Bad or Sopranos?!? \r\n\ud83d\udcfd MOVIE TRIVIA: Some cinematic moments are unforgettable... Or are they? Find out what you remember! (We all know Jack would have fit on that door with Rose)\r\n\ud83d\udc78 DISNEY TRIVIA: Just how well do you know your princes and princesses? \r\n\ud83c\udf1f STAR WARS: Only the biggest fans will know all the answers to these questions from across the galaxy. \r\n\u26a1 HARRY POTTER TRIVIA: There\u2019s only one question that matters... Team Gryffindor, or Team Slytherin? Crack open that wizard trivia book!\r\n\ud83c\udf7f POP CULTURE TRIVIA: The 80\u2019s hair, 90\u2019s jeans, and 00\u2019s boots with the fur... from White Bronco\u2019s to White Castle we cover it all, it\u2019s a trip down memory lane!\r\n\ud83d\udc57 FASHION TRIVIA: Where Reebok, Gucci, Calvin Klein, and 80\u2019s mullets live in harmony.\r\n\ud83c\udf54 FAST FOOD TRIVIA: What\u2019s your guilty pleasure... Burgers, Tacos, Pizza, or Sammiches?\r\n\r\n... And WAY WAY more! Are you a nerd about something? We\u2019ve got the trivia category for you.\r\n\r\n<u>Check out some of Trivia Night\u2019s Unique Features!</u>\r\n\ud83c\udfab TRIVIA PASS: Take a crack at your kind of trivia head on, and elevate your experience with Trivia Pass! Unlock new trivia categories, receive more rewards, and more!\r\n\ud83d\udd25 HARD MODE: Think it\u2019s too easy? Think again, mate. If you\u2019ve got a hankerin\u2019 for some crazy hard trivia, try playing hard mode and see how smart you are! If \u201cboom shakalaka\u201d was a setting, this is it.\r\n\r\nAnd because we know everyone loves to be challenged, but no one likes to swing and miss, we\u2019re here to help you if one of them is a little hard - there are different types of hints at your disposal to help you finish a stage!\r\n\r\n<u>We won\u2019t tell anyone you use these hints, your secret is safe with us.</u>\r\n\u2702 50/50: Takes away two incorrect answers, leaving you with a 50/50 shot of getting the quiz right, no matter what!\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 RE-ROLL: Gives you a different trivia question, (sometimes you need to come back to a challenge, later on in life).\r\n\ud83e\udde8 SOLVE IT: For when you want to get right to the answer and just move it along!\r\n\r\nFace it, you were getting bored with the same trivia questions, asked the same way, across all the other trivia games as we were. So we did something about it. Jam packed with the types of categories you\u2019re interested in Trivia Night brings you a creatively assembled conglomeration of trivia questions, but asked in more innovative ways. With a wide variety of trivia that wanders through a vast range of different categories, it's the contemporary trivia you've been needing in your life.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Trivia the way it should be!<br>- Hundreds of popular trivia categories, designed for regular people!<br>- Multiple types of hints, pick how you want help!<br>- Easy and free to play!<br>- Unique ways of asking questions, you need to be clever as well as smart!<br><br>How is Trivia Night different from the rest? Simple! We found MORE FUN ways of asking YOU all new questions. Ranging from traditional text, to emojis and photos, we\u2019ve assembled a curated collection of trivia that sweeps through hundreds of categories, with questions ranging from easy to hard. And because the questions are often in unique formats, that encourages your brain to find creative ways to connect to the answer. Meaning you have to be clever on some of these!<br><br><u>Take a tour of knowledge with Trivia categories, such as</u>:<br>\ud83c\udfb5 MUSIC TRIVIA: From Pop to Hip Hop, and Rock n Roll to Jazz, we\u2019re going to test how much of a fan you really are.<br>\ud83d\udcfa TV SHOW TRIVIA: We cover all your favorite TV shows! Did you used to watch Cheers or Mash? Pretty Little Liars or 90210? Friends or Seinfeld?! Breaking Bad or Sopranos?!? <br>\ud83d\udcfd MOVIE TRIVIA: Some cinematic moments are unforgettable... Or are they? Find out what you remember! (We all know Jack would have fit on that door with Rose)<br>\ud83d\udc78 DISNEY TRIVIA: Just how well do you know your princes and princesses? <br>\ud83c\udf1f STAR WARS: Only the biggest fans will know all the answers to these questions from across the galaxy. <br>\u26a1 HARRY POTTER TRIVIA: There\u2019s only one question that matters... Team Gryffindor, or Team Slytherin? Crack open that wizard trivia book!<br>\ud83c\udf7f POP CULTURE TRIVIA: The 80\u2019s hair, 90\u2019s jeans, and 00\u2019s boots with the fur... from White Bronco\u2019s to White Castle we cover it all, it\u2019s a trip down memory lane!<br>\ud83d\udc57 FASHION TRIVIA: Where Reebok, Gucci, Calvin Klein, and 80\u2019s mullets live in harmony.<br>\ud83c\udf54 FAST FOOD TRIVIA: What\u2019s your guilty pleasure... Burgers, Tacos, Pizza, or Sammiches?<br><br>... And WAY WAY more! Are you a nerd about something? We\u2019ve got the trivia category for you.<br><br><u>Check out some of Trivia Night\u2019s Unique Features!</u><br>\ud83c\udfab TRIVIA PASS: Take a crack at your kind of trivia head on, and elevate your experience with Trivia Pass! Unlock new trivia categories, receive more rewards, and more!<br>\ud83d\udd25 HARD MODE: Think it\u2019s too easy? Think again, mate. If you\u2019ve got a hankerin\u2019 for some crazy hard trivia, try playing hard mode and see how smart you are! If \u201cboom shakalaka\u201d was a setting, this is it.<br><br>And because we know everyone loves to be challenged, but no one likes to swing and miss, we\u2019re here to help you if one of them is a little hard - there are different types of hints at your disposal to help you finish a stage!<br><br><u>We won\u2019t tell anyone you use these hints, your secret is safe with us.</u><br>\u2702 50/50: Takes away two incorrect answers, leaving you with a 50/50 shot of getting the quiz right, no matter what!<br>\ud83c\udfb2 RE-ROLL: Gives you a different trivia question, (sometimes you need to come back to a challenge, later on in life).<br>\ud83e\udde8 SOLVE IT: For when you want to get right to the answer and just move it along!<br><br>Face it, you were getting bored with the same trivia questions, asked the same way, across all the other trivia games as we were. So we did something about it. Jam packed with the types of categories you\u2019re interested in Trivia Night brings you a creatively assembled conglomeration of trivia questions, but asked in more innovative ways. With a wide variety of trivia that wanders through a vast range of different categories, it&#39;s the contemporary trivia you&#39;ve been needing in your life.",
